      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Additional thing: This issue is still a thing! I learned of this 'cause someone SAT ON MY AVATAR WHEN IT WASSN\"T FULLY SHOWN, and the person had the gall to ARGUE with me about why they don't want to show my avatar so the seat would be marked as OFF, like it is by DEFAULT.\n\nThis issue happened the week of the 9th of Jan, 2025, btw.\n\nI had to block the guy 'cause having a stranger on my back made me stressed and angry, so this issue needs to be repaired SOON.",
